/*
Directive text (0.51). `title` and `subtitle` of `::banner` are `type: text`:
their `code` is `0010`, so their lineIds are `hall~banner~0010~title` and
`hall~banner~0010~subtitle`, and loc/ko.json translates them. `{{userName}}` is
the core host token: the runtime keeps the marker, and the host substitutes it.

The `::group` markers are balanced by the `pair` lint in lute.lint.yaml. Only
lines (and `::actor`, `::sfx`) may sit between them.
*/

## The hall {#hall}

::banner{code="0010" title="Welcome to the hall, {{userName}}" subtitle="Third floor"}
::group{mode="begin"}
@mira{code="0010"}: Welcome back.
@theo{code="0010"}: The lamps are lit.
::group{mode="end"}
